{# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Workstation off-box copy (nix-darwin programs.offboxSync).

   Each run appends one JSON fact per job to offload.jsonl, shipped by the
   Mac's Cribl Edge as index=workstation sourcetype=macos:offbox_sync with
   fields host, job, status (ok | fail | misconfigured), duration_s, detail.
   A misconfigured run emits a single fact with job="-" and runs no job.

   Job health fires only while the agent is actively reporting (a fact in
   the last 30 minutes), so a closed laptop overnight is silence, not an
   alert. Total silence (no fact at all in the 24h window) fires via the
   appendpipe sentinel row, job="(none)".
--------------------------------------------------------------------------- #}
[offbox_sync_job_unhealthy]
description = Fires when a workstation off-box copy job has been reporting for the last 30 minutes without a successful run in 2 hours, or when the agent reports itself misconfigured (it then runs no job at all), or when no fact has arrived for 24 hours. Jobs report every ~6 minutes, so 2 hours is about 20 missed successes. VERIFIED BOTH DIRECTIONS 2026-09-26 against live data: returns 0 rows on the healthy jobs, one row per job when the ok threshold is forced below zero, one row each for a synthetic misconfigured fact and a synthetic failing job with no ok, and one job=(none) row over an empty source.
search = index=workstation sourcetype=macos:offbox_sync | stats max(eval(if(status="ok",_time,null()))) as last_ok max(_time) as last_fact latest(status) as last_status latest(detail) as detail by host job | appendpipe [ stats count as _rows | where _rows == 0 | eval job = "(none)", last_fact = 0 | fields - _rows ] | eval ok_age_m=round((now()-coalesce(last_ok,0))/60), fact_age_m=round((now()-last_fact)/60) | where job="(none)" OR (fact_age_m < 30 AND ((job="-" AND last_status="misconfigured") OR (job!="-" AND ok_age_m > 120)))
dispatch.earliest_time = -24h
dispatch.latest_time = now
cron_schedule = */15 * * * *
enableSched = 1
is_visible = 1
disabled = 0
alert.severity = 4
alert.suppress = 1
alert.suppress.period = 4h
alert.suppress.fields = host,job
alert.track = 1
counttype = number of events
relation = greater than
quantity = 0
